# Build context whitelist for deploy/twin_studio/Dockerfile (Phase 4). Everything else - in
# particular deploy/twin_studio/secrets/, models/, data/ and .env files - never enters an image.
*
!services/
!tests/twin_phase4_integration/
!deploy/twin_studio/requirements.txt
!deploy/twin_studio/specs/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/secrets/
**/.env
